      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.72 (down from ₹8.70 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹67.6m (down 61% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹7.68m (down 92% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 11% (down from 54% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 18% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 35% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
